      "content": "hey, i need to ask u something serious. i think something is wrong with my digital accounts. i've been seeing posts and messages from my own profiles that look exactly like me but they feel... off. like they're mimicking me. is it possible for an ai to actually scrape enough of my data to impersonate my personality perfectly? like, to literally replace me online?",
